+        *   Call `Lorenzo(d, x_1, \dots, x_{d-1}, i, x_{d+1}, \dots, x_n)`.
+
+The starting call for a 4D dataset is `Lorenzo(4, -1, -1, -1, -1)` [S1, unofficial].
 
